# Push completed work to GitHub

When a task is finished and local commits exist that are not on the remote:

1. Push the current branch to `origin` at https://github.com/LinPengyue/migu-causal-chain
2. Do this without waiting for an extra push request if the user already established this standing preference
3. Do not force-push to main/master unless explicitly asked
4. After push, report the remote branch and commit SHAs that were published
